{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/04d94549feb54fa9c8bcc799ea9d7155.webp?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse into Log Away, a cozy sandbox-builder. Whether you're seeking peaceful solitude or creative expression, Log Away offers a relaxing retreat in breathtaking landscapes, from coastal shores to mountain peaks, surrounded by wildlife and beloved pets. Rekindle your inner self through immersive building, decorating, and furnishing of your dream log cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/fd5c39ae303c6f333dfecf8e5b3ff3b7.poster.avif?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/fd5c39ae303c6f333dfecf8e5b3ff3b7.webm?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/fd5c39ae303c6f333dfecf8e5b3ff3b7.mp4?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9395df18d892dd1aad9aa2f25da3cfdd.avif?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with boundless freedom, without time or resource limits. Design your log cabin and its surroundings with over 500 items, whether rustic or whimsical, as every choice reflects your style and story. Choose personal interests, like fishing or painting, to unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themed items such as special bookcases, chairs, equipment, or decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel bags filled with surprise items that add personality and charm to your retreat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/0369eb2c6724314719112d0e92d93743.poster.avif?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/0369eb2c6724314719112d0e92d93743.webm?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/0369eb2c6724314719112d0e92d93743.mp4?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/6f3586249706c6cd140c522f190a33bc.webp?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your log cabin and its surroundings in free-camera or first-person mode. Interact with objects and beloved pets, marvel at landscapes bathed in sunlight or gently rain-soaked under a glowing moon, and admire the beauty of wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/e68bc946b66b606ac711442b5866875b.poster.avif?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/e68bc946b66b606ac711442b5866875b.webm?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/e68bc946b66b606ac711442b5866875b.mp4?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/10c567eb1bffda39c538aba4ad765b68.webp?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize every moment with the Cozy Tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture breathtaking moments with gorgeous screenshots in photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the weather, choosing sunny skies, stormy drama, or gentle rain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the time of day and pause it to create your ideal scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between vivid warm tones, pixelated charm, classic movie look, and other visual styles for a unique vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind with over 20 soulful tracks in western, country, and blues genres, composed by Chris Haugen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/5ea7b544a70d0a42819defa09f1bf0fd.poster.avif?t=1761664236\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/5ea7b544a70d0a42819defa09f1bf0fd.webm?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/5ea7b544a70d0a42819defa09f1bf0fd.mp4?t=1761664236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Log Away</strong> is more than a game\u2014it\u2019s a serene escape crafted to help you reconnect with your inner self. Build, decorate, explore, and ultimately relax in a world all your own, where every choice reflects your heart. Step into your cozy retreat today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468400?t=1761664236","background_raw":"https://shared.aka